{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14245","headline":"奉寄辰州房使君郎中 · 窦常","name":"奉寄辰州房使君郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉代文明今盛明，犹将贾傅暂专城。\n何妨密旨先符竹，莫是除书误姓名。\n蜗舍喜时春梦去，隼旟行处瘴江清。\n新年只可三十二，却笑潘郎白发生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"窦常","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14245.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14245","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}